==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fo|non|verpa}}, from {{inh|fo|gem-pro|*werpaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈvɛɹ̥pa/|lang=fo}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛɹ̥pa|lang=fo}}

===Verb===
{{fo-verb|varp|vurpu|vorpið}}

# to [[lay an egg|lay]] (eggs)

# {{lb|fo|ambitransitive|with accusative}} to [[lay]] (an egg)
#: ''Hønan '''varp''' eitt egg.''
#:: The chicken [[lay an egg|'''laid''' an egg]].

====Conjugation====
{{fo-conj-49|v|e|rp|o|a|u}}

